'''Dynasaurus Cat''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]] gacha event. It was added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]].

