==Trivia==
*Dynasaurus Cat is an obvious reference to the [[wikipedia:Tyrannosaurus|Tyrannosaurus rex]] in both name and design.
*Dynasaurus Cat's attack animation may represent the fiery breath of a dragon, as the Japanese word for dinosaur, 恐竜 ''kyōryū'', literally translates to "fear-dragon".
**It could also be a reference to how certain dinosaurs, namely [[wikipedia:Hadrosauridae|Hadrosaurs]], were once thought to have breathed fire.
*Mecha Dynasaurus Cat's design and Japanese description are likely references to [[wikipedia:Mechagodzilla|Mechagodzilla]]. It particularly resembles [https://wikizilla.org/wiki/Kiryu Kiryu] and [https://wikizilla.org/wiki/Mechagodzilla_(Monsterverse) Monsterverse Mechagodzilla].
*Even though Mecha Dynasaurus Cat's Japanese description mentions attacking extraterrestrial invaders, its ability does not target [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]].

